  <data key="d0">ATPΓS TRIPHOSPHORYL POSITIONING</data>
  <data key="d1">REACTION_STEP</data>
  <data key="d2">Functional positioning of the nucleotide triphosphoryl moiety, especially the alpha-phosphoryl group, inferred from Ser192 hydrogen-bonding geometry.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.84</data>
  <data key="d4">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_5</data>
  <data key="d5">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
