<node id="CATALYTIC TURNOVER KCAT">
  <data key="d0">CATALYTIC TURNOVER KCAT</data>
  <data key="d1">KINETIC_PARAMETER</data>
  <data key="d2">Catalytic activity parameter reduced by more than 10-fold in the S192A MDD mutant, supporting a catalytic role for Ser192. | Enzyme turnover number measured for WT and selected PMDsc mutants; WT kcat was 0.15 s^-1, while values among variants included 0.029-0.35 s^-1.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.8</data>
  <data key="d4">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_5,a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_11</data>
  <data key="d6">0.88</data>
  <data key="d5">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257,8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294</data>
  <data key="d7">CATALYTIC TURNOVER KCAT</data>
</node>
