  <data key="d0">SUBSTRATE-BINDING KM</data>
  <data key="d1">KINETIC_PARAMETER</data>
  <data key="d2">Substrate-binding kinetic parameter reported to remain near wild-type values in the S192A mutant, indicating Ser192 mainly affects catalysis rather than substrate location or binding affinity.</data>
