  <data key="d0">MVAPP CARBOXYLATE AND C3-HYDROXYL MISORIENTATION</data>
  <data key="d1">DYNAMICAL_STATE</data>
  <data key="d2">Approximately 120° rotation of the MVAPP carboxylate and C3-hydroxyl groups observed in the D283A mutant relative to wild type.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.9</data>
  <data key="d4">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_8</data>
  <data key="d5">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
</node>
