  <data key="d0">WILD-TYPE MDD FUNNEL AREA</data>
  <data key="d1">POCKET_GEOMETRY</data>
  <data key="d2">Active-site funnel area of wild-type MDD measured at approximately 145 Å^2, used as a geometric comparator for mutant ternary complexes.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.62</data>
  <data key="d4">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_8</data>
  <data key="d5">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
