  <data key="d0">WT MDD ACTIVE-SITE FUNNEL</data>
  <data key="d1">POCKET_GEOMETRY</data>
  <data key="d2">Wild-type MDD active-site funnel in the ternary cocrystal structure, with an approximate area of 145 Å².</data>
  <data key="d3">0.88</data>
  <data key="d4">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_9</data>
  <data key="d5">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
</node>
<node id="S192A ENLARGED ACTIVE-SITE FUNNEL">
  <data key="d0">S192A ENLARGED ACTIVE-SITE FUNNEL</data>
  <data key="d1">POCKET_GEOMETRY</data>
  <data key="d2">Active-site funnel in S192A MDD, enlarged more than twofold relative to wild type to approximately 300 Å².</data>
  <data key="d3">0.94</data>
  <data key="d4">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_9</data>
  <data key="d5">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
</node>
