  <data key="d0">D283A OCCLUDED ACTIVE-SITE FUNNEL</data>
  <data key="d1">POCKET_GEOMETRY</data>
  <data key="d2">Active-site funnel in D283A MDD, reduced to approximately 99 Å², about 50% smaller than the wild-type funnel.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.94</data>
  <data key="d4">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_9</data>
  <data key="d5">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
</node>
