  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">Buffer-exchange and ligand-soaking procedure in PEG3350/MgCl2/sodium acetate soaking buffer, with ligands added to 2 mM final concentration for one-day soaking.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.7</data>
  <data key="d4">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_15</data>
  <data key="d5">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe</data>
</node>
