  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">The mevalonate 5-diphosphate substrate or substrate-like ligand abbreviated MVAPP. The cited literature states that mevalonate 5-diphosphate mediates ATP binding to mevalonate diphosphate decarboxylase.</data>
