  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">Divalent cobalt ion present in the MDD_EF-MVAPP-ADP-SO4^2--Co2+ structure. The spelling is corrected from the ambiguous all-caps form to indicate cobalt rather than carbon dioxide.</data>
