<node id="MEVALONATE PATHWAY">
  <data key="d0">MEVALONATE PATHWAY</data>
  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">The metabolic pathway discussed in the references and biologically contextualizing mevalonate diphosphate decarboxylase function. | The broader biochemical pathway context for producing isoprenoid precursors. The text references its in vitro reconstitution, targeted engineering, and use in engineered Escherichia coli.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.68</data>
