  <data key="d1">SEQUENCE_FEATURE</data>
  <data key="d2">Sequence- or structure-associated enzyme features inferred from comparative structural studies to govern substrate discrimination and catalytic behavior in mevalonate diphosphate decarboxylase.</data>
