  <data key="d1">SELECTIVITY_PROFILE</data>
  <data key="d2">The selectivity profile describing which substrates are preferred, tolerated, or excluded by mevalonate decarboxylase enzymes. It is central to the cited substrate specificity and engineering work.</data>
