  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">Structural evidence from crystal structures of mevalonate diphosphate decarboxylase enzymes from Trypanosoma brucei and Staphylococcus aureus. These structures are cited as informing determinants of enzyme specificity and reactivity.</data>
