  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental evidence based on mutation and inhibition analysis of mevalonate 5-diphosphate decarboxylase. These studies support mechanistic assignment of residues or features influencing catalysis and specificity.</data>
