  <data key="d0">PROTEIN KINASE CATALYTIC DOMAIN</data>
  <data key="d1">DOMAIN</data>
  <data key="d2">The conserved catalytic domain of protein kinases that organizes residues and nucleotide-binding elements required for phosphoryl-transfer chemistry.</data>
