  <data key="d0">TRANSITION STATE OF PROTEIN PHOSPHORYLATION</data>
  <data key="d1">REACTION_STEP</data>
  <data key="d2">A high-energy mechanistic state in the protein phosphorylation reaction. It is experimentally represented by AlF3 in a crystal structure of nucleoside diphosphate kinase with MgADP.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.86</data>
  <data key="d4">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_18</data>
  <data key="d5">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe</data>
</node>
