  <data key="d0">ALF3 TRANSITION-STATE MIMIC</data>
  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">An experimental transition-state mimic used in structural analysis of phosphorylation chemistry. AlF3 is cited as mimicking the transition state of protein phosphorylation.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.78</data>
  <data key="d4">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_18</data>
  <data key="d5">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe</data>
