  <data key="d0">K187 RESIDUE</data>
  <data key="d1">RESIDUE</data>
  <data key="d2">The lysine residue at position 187 in MDD that is altered in the K187A mutant. The excerpt does not provide its mechanistic role, but its mutation indicates it was experimentally important for comparison with wild-type MDD.</data>
