  <data key="d1">KINETIC_PARAMETER</data>
  <data key="d2">Energetic or binding-associated parameters measured for MDD samples. Although described as thermodynamics rather than kinetics, this is represented under the available parameter type because the valid schema does not include a separate thermodynamic-parameter class.</data>
