  <data key="d1">REACTION_STEP</data>
  <data key="d2">The decarboxylation phase associated with mevalonate pyrophosphate/diphosphate decarboxylase chemistry. The excerpt references evidence for a carbocationic transition state in related decarboxylase chemistry.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.67</data>
  <data key="d4">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_19</data>
