  <data key="d0">CARBOCATIONIC TRANSITION STATE</data>
  <data key="d1">REACTION_STEP</data>
  <data key="d2">A proposed high-energy transition-state character involving carbocation-like charge development during pyrophosphate/diphosphate decarboxylase chemistry. The excerpt only cites this concept bibliographically and does not provide mechanistic details.</data>
