  <data key="d1">KINETIC_PARAMETER</data>
  <data key="d2">Physicochemical parameters reported for adenosine phosphates and related compounds. These values can constrain interpretation of phosphate protonation and charge states relevant to phosphoryl-transfer chemistry.</data>
