  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">A cited biochemical context involving inhibition of cholesterol biosynthesis by 6-fluoromevalonate, relevant to mevalonate-pathway chemistry but not directly elaborated in the excerpt.</data>
