</node>
<node id="MDD PROTEIN">
  <data key="d0">MDD PROTEIN</data>
  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">The protein studied in the work. The excerpt states that the MDD protein was cloned and that both mutant and wild-type forms were purified for enzymology, thermodynamics, and crystallization.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.82</data>
  <data key="d4">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_20,701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_21</data>
