  <data key="d0">ENZYMOLOGY CHARACTERIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">Functional enzymology studies performed on purified K187A mutant and wild-type MDD proteins. The excerpt does not provide kinetic parameters such as kcat, Km, or catalytic efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.67</data>
  <data key="d4">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_20</data>
  <data key="d5">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe</data>
