  <data key="d0">HETEROLOGOUS MVA PATHWAY IN E. COLI</data>
  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">Engineered mevalonate pathway introduced into E. coli to produce isopentenol through isoprenoid intermediates including IPP.</data>
