  <data key="d0">PMDSC ACTIVE-SITE MVAPP POSE</data>
  <data key="d1">POCKET_GEOMETRY</data>
  <data key="d2">Predicted placement of MVAPP in the PMDsc active site obtained by aligning substrate-free PMDsc structure with substrate-analog-bound PMDse structures.</data>
