  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">Alignment of PMDsc crystal structure PDB 1FI4 with homologous PMDse structure PDB 4DPT to infer the substrate-bound active-site geometry of PMDsc. | Evidence from structural alignment of PMDsc structure 1FI4 with homologous Staphylococcus epidermidis PMD, supporting residue-function assignments in the active site.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.83</data>
  <data key="d4">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_7</data>
  <data key="d5">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a,8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294</data>
  <data key="d6">0.83</data>
  <data key="d7">PMDSC-PMDSE STRUCTURAL ALIGNMENT EVIDENCE</data>
</node>
<node id="PMDSE SUBSTRATE-ANALOG-BOUND STRUCTURES">
  <data key="d0">PMDSE SUBSTRATE-ANALOG-BOUND STRUCTURES</data>
  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
