  <data key="d0">SYNTHETIC PATHWAY FOR FIVE-CARBON ALCOHOL PRODUCTION FROM ISOPENTENYL DIPHOSPHATE</data>
  <data key="d1">REACTION_STEP</data>
  <data key="d2">A cited engineered biosynthetic route converting isopentenyl diphosphate toward five-carbon alcohol products.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.82</data>
  <data key="d4">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_13</data>
  <data key="d5">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a</data>
