  <data key="d0">OPTIMIZED CONVENTIONAL MVA PATHWAY PERFORMANCE IN ESCHERICHIA COLI</data>
  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">Prior optimization of the conventional MVA pathway in Escherichia coli achieved 2.2 g/L isopentenol with 70% of apparent theoretical yield.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.85</data>
  <data key="d4">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294_chunk_1</data>
  <data key="d5">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294</data>
