  <data key="d0">MVAP SUBSTRATE-BINDING MODE</data>
  <data key="d1">POCKET_GEOMETRY</data>
  <data key="d2">The positioning and interaction pattern of MVAP in PMDsc; proposed to be altered by distal helical residues including those on H4.</data>
