  <data key="d0">MUTANT SCREENING PLATFORM</data>
  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">The strain-based platform used to identify PMDsc mutants with enhanced isopentenol production and to compare production titers with growth rates.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.9</data>
  <data key="d4">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294_chunk_8</data>
  <data key="d5">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294</data>
