  <data key="d0">FIG. 6 REPLICATE DATA</data>
  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">Experimental evidence showing isopentenol titers and growth rates for 21 mutants as filled circles, with standard deviations from three biological replicates and a linear-regression trend line.</data>
