  <data key="d0">COLONY-TO-COLONY VARIATION</data>
  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">Observed variation, especially for R74S-containing mutants, that may broaden measured isopentenol titer distributions in overproducing strains.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.55</data>
  <data key="d4">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294_chunk_8</data>
  <data key="d5">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294</data>
</node>
