  <data key="d0">KINETIC-PHENOTYPE DECOUPLING</data>
  <data key="d1">EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">The reported lack of significant correlation between in vitro kinetic parameters of mutant PMDs and isopentenol titer or cell growth, despite a positive correlation between titer and growth rate.</data>
  <data key="d3">0.8</data>
  <data key="d4">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294_chunk_8</data>
  <data key="d5">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294</data>
</node>
