  <data key="d0">MVAP SUBSTRATE LACKING BETA-PHOSPHATE</data>
  <data key="d1">CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-native MVAP substrate context in which the beta-phosphate group present in native MVAPP is absent, altering active-site packing requirements.</data>
