  <data key="d1">SEQUENCE_FEATURE</data>
  <data key="d2">Wild-type and mutant PMDsc sequence variants generated by codon saturation mutagenesis and random mutagenesis to improve phosphomevalonate decarboxylation activity toward MVAP.</data>
