<edge source="ASP283" target="MVAPP C3-HYDROXYL DEPROTONATION">
  <data key="d8">ASP283</data>
  <data key="d9">MVAPP C3-HYDROXYL DEPROTONATION</data>
  <data key="d10">MEDIATES</data>
  <data key="d11">Asp283 acts as the general base that deprotonates the MVAPP C3 hydroxyl. | Asp283 mediates deprotonation of the MVAPP C3-hydroxyl by functioning as a general base. | Asp283 is identified as the general base responsible for deprotonating the MVAPP C3-hydroxyl. | Asp283 acts as the catalytic base that abstracts the acidic proton from the MVAPP C3-hydroxyl. | Asp283 functions as the catalytic base by aiding abstraction of the MVAPP C3-hydroxyl proton.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.98</data>
  <data key="d13">1</data>
  <data key="d14">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_0</data>
