  <data key="d8">NO STABLY COORDINATED MG2+ OBSERVED</data>
  <data key="d9">ATPΓS-BOUND FMVAPP TERNARY MDD STATE</data>
  <data key="d10">CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_ON</data>
  <data key="d11">The absence of interpretable Mg2+ density is specific to the ternary crystallization context despite high MgCl2 concentration.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.62</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
  <data key="d14">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_5</data>
