  <data key="d8">ABSENCE OF STABLY COORDINATED MG2+</data>
  <data key="d9">CATALYTICALLY PRODUCTIVE MDD TERNARY CONFORMATION</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">Without coordinated Mg2+, the ternary complex is less likely to adopt or reveal a catalytically productive conformation.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.9</data>
  <data key="d13">1</data>
  <data key="d14">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_6</data>
  <data key="d15">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
</edge>
