  <data key="d9">CATALYTICALLY PRODUCTIVE MDD TERNARY CONFORMATION</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">The approximately 5.5 Å separation is larger than expected for a productive phosphoryl-transfer geometry and therefore constrains catalytic competence.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.82</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
  <data key="d14">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_6</data>
