  <data key="d9">ATP-FIRST OCCLUDED ACCEPTOR-BINDING STATE</data>
  <data key="d10">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">Because the acceptor site lies at the bottom of the funnel, ATP binding first can block access to the MVAPP site.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.9</data>
  <data key="d13">1</data>
  <data key="d14">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257_chunk_10</data>
  <data key="d15">a9c7009e-9e90-565c-abe8-c021976be257</data>
