  <data key="d9">STABILIZED Β10-Α4 LOOP CONFIGURATION</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">Interactions between MVAPP pyrophosphate and helix α4 residues constrain the β10-α4 loop into a defined configuration.</data>
