  <data key="d9">IN-LINE PRE-PHOSPHORYL-TRANSFER GEOMETRY</data>
  <data key="d10">DETERMINES</data>
  <data key="d11">Because BeF3− mimics the ATP γ-phosphoryl group, its position between ADP Oβ and MVAPP 3′-oxygen defines the in-line transfer geometry.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.9</data>
  <data key="d13">1</data>
  <data key="d14">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_4</data>
