  <data key="d9">PRE-PHOSPHORYL-TRANSFER STEP</data>
  <data key="d10">DETERMINES</data>
  <data key="d11">The nearly linear Oβ–Be–3′O arrangement and transfer-distance contacts identify the complex as a pre-phosphoryl-transfer state. | The 178° in-line angle and 3.7 Å MVAPP 3′-oxygen to Be distance are compatible with phosphoryl transfer.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.96</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
  <data key="d14">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_4</data>
  <data key="d15">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe</data>
</edge>
