  <data key="d9">PHOSPHORYL TRANSFER STEP</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">Water exclusion constrains nonspecific or wasteful phosphoryl transfer during the MDD reaction.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.82</data>
