  <data key="d9">PHOSPHORYL TRANSFER STEP</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">The 6.1 Å donor-acceptor distance is too long relative to the closed ADPBeF3 geometry, making phosphoryl transfer unlikely in the open state.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.91</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
