  <data key="d9">ATP BINDING</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">Divalent metal ions constrain nucleotide binding and catalytic geometry in MDD, influencing how ATP binds and participates in catalysis.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.72</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
