  <data key="d9">KINASE ACTIVITY</data>
  <data key="d10">DETERMINES</data>
  <data key="d11">A cited study reports that a single amino acid mutation converts diphosphomevalonate decarboxylase into a kinase, making the mutation a determinant of kinase-like activity.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.92</data>
  <data key="d13">1</data>
  <data key="d14">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe_chunk_17</data>
  <data key="d15">701d8434-7f71-5da9-bb94-e869d94e65fe</data>
</edge>
