  <data key="d9">ISOPENTENOL TITER</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">In pathway II, isopentenol titer is comparatively constrained against variation from upstream HMGS/HMGR pair changes.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.84</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
  <data key="d14">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_10</data>
  <data key="d15">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a</data>
</edge>
