  <data key="d9">PATHWAY II ATP REQUIREMENT</data>
  <data key="d10">COUPLES_TO</data>
  <data key="d11">IPP-bypass pathway II is coupled to a lower ATP demand of 2 ATP molecules per isopentenol molecule.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.92</data>
  <data key="d13">1</data>
  <data key="d14">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_11</data>
  <data key="d15">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a</data>
