  <data key="d9">CONVENTIONAL IPP-DEPENDENT MVA PATHWAY</data>
  <data key="d10">SHIFTS</data>
  <data key="d11">The engineered pathway shifts production away from an IPP-dependent conventional MVA route toward an IPP-bypass route with lower toxicity and ATP demand.</data>
