  <data key="d9">AERATION-LIMITED ISOPENTENOL PRODUCTION CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d10">CONTEXT_DEPENDENT_ON</data>
  <data key="d11">The reported robustness advantage of the IPP-bypass pathway is described under aeration-limited production conditions.</data>
