  <data key="d8">PMDSC T209</data>
  <data key="d9">PMDSC MVAP PROMISCUOUS ACTIVITY PROFILE</data>
  <data key="d10">ALLOWS</data>
  <data key="d11">The neutral T209 residue in PMDsc, replacing the positively charged arginine found in PMDse, is proposed to allow greater promiscuity toward MVAP.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.83</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
  <data key="d14">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_7</data>
