  <data key="d9">PMDSE VERSUS PMDSC IN VIVO MVAP ACTIVITY EVIDENCE</data>
  <data key="d10">SUPPORTED_BY</data>
  <data key="d11">The proposed role of PMDsc T209 in permissive MVAP activity is indirectly supported by the PMDsc versus PMDse production difference.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.65</data>
  <data key="d13">3</data>
  <data key="d14">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_7</data>
