<edge source="PMDSE HIGH MVAPP SPECIFICITY PROFILE" target="PMDSC KCAT/KM FOR MVAPP">
  <data key="d8">PMDSE HIGH MVAPP SPECIFICITY PROFILE</data>
  <data key="d9">PMDSE KCAT/KM FOR MVAPP</data>
  <data key="d10">MEASURED_BY</data>
  <data key="d11">PMDse high specificity for MVAPP is measured by its reported kcat/Km of 6.5 × 10^5 s^-1 M^-1.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.81</data>
  <data key="d13">1</data>
  <data key="d14">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_7</data>
  <data key="d15">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="PMDSE HIGH MVAPP SPECIFICITY PROFILE" target="PMD-MEDIATED MVAP REACTION">
  <data key="d8">PMDSE HIGH MVAPP SPECIFICITY PROFILE</data>
  <data key="d9">PMD-MEDIATED MVAP REACTION</data>
  <data key="d10">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">Higher PMDse specificity for MVAPP helps explain why PMDse performs poorly on the non-native MVAP-linked isopentenol pathway.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.8</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
  <data key="d14">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a_chunk_7</data>
  <data key="d15">dd599823-57fe-59b5-bf71-6ef7c22b4a8a</data>
</edge>
