  <data key="d9">ISOPENTENOL TITER</data>
  <data key="d10">DETERMINES</data>
  <data key="d11">The text proposes that PMD activity toward MVAP, rather than upstream pathway efficiency, is the determining factor for isopentenol production in pathway II.</data>
