  <data key="d9">UPSTREAM MVA PATHWAY BALANCING BURDEN</data>
  <data key="d10">CONSTRAINS</data>
  <data key="d11">Because pathway II is insensitive to MVA level and MK expression level and bypasses IPP toxicity, it reduces the engineering burden of balancing the upstream pathway.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.82</data>
