  <data key="d9">IPP ACCUMULATION AND TOXICITY</data>
  <data key="d10">ALLOWS</data>
  <data key="d11">The original MVA pathway produces IPP and is associated with IPP accumulation and toxicity as an intrinsic limitation.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.79</data>
