  <data key="d8">PMD PROMISCUITY</data>
  <data key="d9">ISOPENTENOL YIELD</data>
  <data key="d10">SHIFTS</data>
  <data key="d11">Further engineering of PMD promiscuity is expected to increase isopentenol yield by relieving the bottleneck.</data>
