  <data key="d8">MVAP DECARBOXYLATION ACTIVITY</data>
  <data key="d9">DH1 GROWTH RATE</data>
  <data key="d10">DETERMINES</data>
  <data key="d11">Under sensitive expression conditions, the growth rate of DH1 strains depends on PMDsc MVAP decarboxylation activity.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.93</data>
  <data key="d13">2</data>
  <data key="d14">8b12a598-340d-5340-aebf-b31ea016d294_chunk_3</data>
