  <data key="d9">GROWTH RECOVERY UNDER FOSMIDOMYCIN</data>
  <data key="d10">SUPPORTED_BY</data>
  <data key="d11">Lack of observed adaptive fosmidomycin resistance supports the interpretation that growth recovery resulted from the engineered pathway rather than resistance mutations.</data>
  <data key="d12">0.78</data>
  <data key="d13">3</data>
